  "content": "<div id=\"wrapper\"> <div class=\"box\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"boxx\"> <div class=\"logo\"><a href=\"../../index.html\"><img src=\"../../static/home/images/logo.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> <div class=\"pc_nav\"> <ul> <li class=\"le\"><a href=\"../../product.html\">产品</a> <div class=\"dnou2\"> <a href=\"45.html\">安全数据库集中式</a> <a href=\"2.html\">安全数据库分布式</a> <a href=\"3.html\">数据库管理平台</a> <a href=\"47.html\">数据迁移服务平台</a> </div> </li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"../../news/cid/52.html\">解决方案</a> </li> <li class=\"le\"><a href=\"../../case.html\">客户案例</a> <div class=\"dnou2\"> <a href=\"../../cases/8.html\">金融</a> <a href=\"../../cases/9.html\">电信</a> <a href=\"../../cases/10.html\">能源</a> <a href=\"../../cases/7.html\">政府</a> </div> </li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"../../zt/mysql-57-eol.html\">5.7停服专区</a> </li> <li class=\"le\"><a href=\"../../about.html\">关于我们</a> <div class=\"dnou2\"> <a href=\"../../about/cid/44.html\">公司介绍</a> <a href=\"../../career.html\">加入我们</a> <a href=\"../../about/cid/38.html\">测试报告</a> <a href=\"../../news/cid/40.html\">公司新闻</a> <a href=\"../../about/cid/37.html\">兼容列表</a> <a href=\"../../news/cid/41.html\">行业前瞻</a> <a href=\"../../partner.html\">合作伙伴</a> </div> </li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://greatsql.cn\">开源社区</a></li> <li class=\"le\"><a href=\"../../down.html\">下载服务</a> <div class=\"dnou2\"> <a href=\"../../down/cid/49.html\">安全漏洞补丁下载</a> <a href=\"../../down.html\">软件下载</a> <a href=\"../../down/cid/43.html\">文档下载</a> </div> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"pc_m\"> <p class=\"zcdl\"><a href=\"../../Home/mfsy/mfsy.html\">免费试用</a></p> </div> <button id=\"mm-menu-toggle\" class=\"mm-menu-toggle\">Toggle Menu</button> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"bantu\" style=\"background:url(../../Uploads/20230907/7cb990721eaef6beff46bf50d785ff7b.jpg) no-repeat center center\"> <div class=\"ban_z ban_z1\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p class=\"wow fadeInDown\" data-wow-delay=\"100ms\">数据迁移服务平台GreatDTS</p> <h4 class=\"wow fadeInDown\" data-wow-delay=\"50ms\"><a href=\"../../Home/mfsy/mfsy.html\">免费试用</a></h4> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"cp\"> <div class=\"cp_t\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"cp_tl wow fadeInLeft\" > <h2>概述</h2> <p>GreatDTS 是一款提供评估、迁移、同步和校验一体化解决方案的数据库迁移产品，支持 GreatDB、Oracle、MySQL、 Kafka 等数据源之间的全量数据迁移和增量数据同步，实现数据迁移、异地容灾等业务场景。通过支持业务数据的按需分发、数据集中和复制管理，降低企业异构数据迁移的成本，协助企业构建灵活、可靠、稳定的数据服务平台。</p> </div> <div class=\"cp_tr wow fadeInRight\"> <img src=\"../../Uploads/20230907/3dfd7d2cce78f4dfdef9845067ed563f.png\" alt=\"\" /> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"cp_m\"> <div class=\"container\"> <h3 class=\"wow fadeInDown\">关键技术特性</h3> <div class=\"cp_mm\"> <dl class=\" wow fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"100ms\"> <dt><span>精准转换</span><img src=\"../../Uploads/20230907/0e36aab0bed9b5d88eef8f22265696cd.png\" alt=\"\" /></dt> <dd> <p>支持 Oracle 对象兼容转换； 支持普通表转换为分布式表。</p> </dd> </dl> <dl class=\" wow fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"150ms\"> <dt><span>准确评估</span><img src=\"../../Uploads/20230907/ecd7cd9ce858a7e69fbddd9ca93a3b29.png\" alt=\"\" /></dt> <dd> <p>快速准确评估对象定义和应用 SQL 兼容性，给出详细评估改造点及改造建议。 </p> </dd> </dl> <dl class=\" wow fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"200ms\"> <dt><span>断点续传</span><img src=\"../../Uploads/20230907/bade591041ef31b36487edff13ec98ae.png\" alt=\"\" /></dt> <dd> <p>系统或网络不稳定情况下，断点续传功能可保障迁移任务有效完成。</p> </dd> </dl> <dl class=\"bg wow fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"250ms\"> <dt><span>数据零丢失</span><img src=\"../../Uploads/20230907/cad44078e9ee5f9cc59eff644a4e7102.png\" alt=\"\" /></dt> <dd> <p>事务级控制，数据零丢失。</p> </dd> </dl> <dl class=\" wow fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"300ms\"> <dt><span>灵活同步</span><img src=\"../../Uploads/20230907/53733c49ce293a0b92df22c307ae620b.png\" alt=\"\" /></dt> <dd> <p>支持异构数据库间数据同步； 支持异地数据容灾。</p> </dd> </dl> <dl class=\" wow fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"100ms\"> <dt><span>快速验证</span><img src=\"../../Uploads/20230907/90c7a21bcadda3ca2d05888130768725.png\" alt=\"\" /></dt> <dd> <p>支持行数校验、数据一致性校验； 通过多线程并发校验，提高校验速度和效率。</p> </dd> </dl> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"cp_m2\"> <div class=\"container\"> <h3 class=\"wow fadeInDown\">解决方案</h3> <div class=\"cp_mm2\"> <ul> <li class=\" wow fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"100ms\"> <a href=\"../../Home/news/solution_v/id/595.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <h2>数据库上云解决方案</h2> <p>万里GreatDTS迁移评估工具保证数据复制服务的在线迁移特性，实现数据库平滑迁移上云。</p> </a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"cp_b\"> <div class=\"container\"> <h3 class=\"wow fadeInDown\">应用场景</h3> <div class=\"cp_bb\"> <div class=\"menuTitle2\">Oracle国产化</div> <div class=\"menuContent2\" style=\"display: none;\"> <div> <p>核心业务 Oracle 数据库到 GreatDB 的国产化迁移场景； </p> </div> </div> <div class=\"clear\"></div> <div class=\"menuTitle2\">异地多活</div> <div class=\"menuContent2\" style=\"display: none;\"> <div> <p>数据分布在不同地域的异地多活场景</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"clear\"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"footer\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"foot_t\"> <div class=\"foot_tl\"> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../product.html\">产品</a></h2> <li><a href=\"45.html\">安全数据库集中式</a> <li><a href=\"2.html\">安全数据库分布式</a> <li><a href=\"3.html\">数据库管理平台</a> <li><a href=\"47.html\">数据迁移服务平台</a> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../news/cid/52.html\">解决方案</a></h2> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../case.html\">客户案例</a></h2> <li><a href=\"../../cases/8.html\">金融</a> <li><a href=\"../../cases/9.html\">电信</a> <li><a href=\"../../cases/10.html\">能源</a> <li><a href=\"../../cases/7.html\">政府</a> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../zt/mysql-57-eol.html\">5.7停服专区</a></h2> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../about.html\">关于我们</a></h2> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../partner.html\">合作伙伴</a></h2> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../down.html\">下载服务</a></h2> </ul> </div> <div class=\"foot_tr\"> <img src=\"../../static/home/tu/ewm.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <p>关注我们</p> </div> <div class=\"foot_tb\"> <font>友情链接：</font> <span> <em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.troy.cn\">创意信息</a></em> <em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.grid-elec.com\">格蒂电力</a></em> <em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http